From e68aae89d92bb57449f2aa68a5562a8c591305f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: L20 Port <port@l20.local>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 07:32:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Port NInfer to NVIDIA L20 (sm_89 / Ada, CUDA 12.8)

- CMAKE: default to sm_89, keep sm_120a; define NINFER_L20_NO_PDL on sm_89
- pdl.cuh: PDL (griddepcontrol) requires sm_90+; degrade to plain in-order
  stream launches on sm_89 (correct, PDL is latency-only)
- mma.cuh: use plain e4m3 MMA on sm_89 (kind::f8f6f4 is sm_120-only);
  guard mxf4nvf4 block-scale MMA behind sm_120
- startup.cpp: accept compute capability 8.9 alongside 12.0
- ops CMake: exclude sm_120-only NVFP4 *weight* kernels on sm_89 and link
  nvfp4_l20_stub.cpp (throws a clear error); NVFP4 KV-cache kernels (software
  dequant) are kept
- new: src/ops/nvfp4_l20_stub.cpp
---
